From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 06:27:53 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] kosmickrisp: test a Metal queue that rejects every commit

The probe a quiet Metal queue gets before it is called stopped (see
"lose the device when the Metal command queue stops") is tested here, after
the shared test harness the test is written against, not with that topic.

The test queue_denied reproduces the denial on a Mac by rejecting commits
and dropping signals in the Metal queue's own methods. In after-failure a
rejected commit is recovered and a signal-only submit follows on the queue
that replaced the failed one; in first-op the signal-only submit is the
first thing the denied queue sees. Both end their wait in about a second
(1.03 s and 1.04 s), keep the device and serve work again when the GPU is
back. In legit-wait nothing is denied and a commit and its signal wait
behind a wait only the host can release: the queue is not probed, nothing
is completed early and the device stays, for 3.5 s. Two mutations fail it:
no probe, and a probe that ignores unanswered work.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/meson.build            |  19 +
 .../vulkan/tests/test_queue_denied.m          | 370 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 389 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/tests/test_queue_denied.m

diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/meson.build b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/meson.build
index 388628cb754022a955d779cda7b11fcbd25311a5..4e1365f48c3881ef42f66fa9d07d1a0f9677f07f 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/meson.build
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/meson.build
@@ -495,6 +495,25 @@ if with_tests
         timeout : 90,
